<title>UK: Clariant AG sets 150 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Clariant AG sets 150 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLARIANT AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.125     MATURITY    29.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.875   PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS				    EOS	   01.NOV.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
